  <p id="c-chenshu-016-zhangyaoer-cai:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-chenshu-016-zhangyaoer-cai:p001:m0000" ref="3iw_d6v_459_A">蔡景歷</persName>字<persName id="c-chenshu-016-zhangyaoer-cai:p001:m0004" ref="3iw_d6v_459_A">茂世</persName>，濟陽考城人也。祖<persName id="c-chenshu-016-zhangyaoer-cai:p001:m0015" ref="9uu_px7_81u">點</persName>，梁尚書左民侍郎。父<persName id="c-chenshu-016-zhangyaoer-cai:p001:m0026" ref="3iw_d6v_459">大同</persName>，輕車岳陽王記室參軍，掌京邑行選。</p>
